<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Kindred</h1>
<p><i>The charter of the clan Kindred, kept as it was written.</i>
</p><p>Kindred Clan values loyalty above all else. Loyalty to the clan and to your clan mates. We protect what is ours and each other. We are an outspoken clan who have no qualms about letting others know our opinions. We are willing to accept the consequences.
</p><p>Members of Kindred are expected to be self-sufficient. If a member of the clan needs assistance the clan will assist. In personal matters of honor we will not intercede but will ensure that no others take advantage of a member.
</p><p>Our purpose is domination through strength. Knowledge gained through our own efforts and camaraderie. We will protect the honor of Kindred and of the members. Clan members shall be adults and clan membership is by invitation only. We invite only those we deem worthy to be members.
</p><p>Kindred are the Elite. We shall remain small rather than become less than we are.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
